{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415660","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415660","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041566001:1":{"text":"후긴! 마침 잘 왔어. 지난 번에 얘기했던 새로운 작품 좀 보여달라고!","source_cn":"呼金！你来得正好！上次你提到的新作品，拿来给我看看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C11DD92921A3323","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041566002:1":{"text":"조아 스승님! 여기는 무슨 일이십니까?","source_cn":"祖娅老师！你居然在这？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD838C1DCA6A47F69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041566003:1":{"text":"왜, 나는 오면 안 돼?","source_cn":"怎么，我不能来吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x347D12C7A338CE22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041566004:1":{"text":"말 돌리지 말고! 지난 번에 새로운 작품을 꽤 만들었다고 하지 않았어? 어서 가져와!","source_cn":"别岔开话题！上次见面时你不是说搞了不少新东西吗？快拿来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9132D4DF369CA98F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041566005:1":{"text":"아, 윽, 그게... 아, 네! 작품이요. 네, 제 귀여운 작품들!","source_cn":"啊、呃、啊、呃，成品，对，我可爱的成品！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD11E91FADE252A71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041566006:1":{"text":"조금만 기다려 주시면 그 귀여운 아이들을 보여드리죠!","source_cn":"等下我就带着我可爱的孩子们来见你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BEC846F237FA575","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041566007:1":{"text":"이름도 안 붙인 미완성품 말고, 제대로 이름까지 붙인 녀석들로 들고 와!","source_cn":"别拿那些没起名字的来凑数，要拿你起好名字的完全版！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x158C3F1E026EE9A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041566008:1":{"text":"아, 맞다! 지난 번에 준 설계도 제작은 다 끝났어?","source_cn":"接下来，你之前那些设计图都落实了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17699E53931F5D29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041566009:1":{"text":"설계도는 아직 수정을 좀...","source_cn":"设计图，有些我后续有过修改——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E588C0EF72210F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041566010:1":{"text":"그럼 수정본까지 전부 다 가져와.","source_cn":"那修改版都拿来给我看一眼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F0957342AB56B70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041566011:1":{"text":"최신 연구 문헌은 얼마나 읽었지? 최근에 쓴 글은 있고?","source_cn":"最新的成果文献看过没有？你写了多少？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3442F50976512E23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041566012:1":{"text":"요즘 드워프 쪽에는 새로운 게 없는데요, 스승님...","source_cn":"矮人这边几乎没什么新东西，祖娅老师……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2944A6F3729DAF6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041566013:1":{"text":"기계와 발명 쪽만 보는 거야? 라이세움의 최신 논문은!","source_cn":"你只看机械和发明相关的？莱希拉姆的最新论文看过了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DDB11BB4C673377","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041566014:1":{"text":"에메랄드 호수 마법 아카데미에서 발표한 신소재 분석 보고서는!","source_cn":"翡湖学院提出的新材料研究有分析过吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8778907119876F17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041566015:1":{"text":"도, 돌아가면 꼭 보겠습니다!","source_cn":"这、这，我回去就看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3448308D639C6B84","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041566016:1":{"text":"멀린한테 라이세움이 학생을 가르치는 방법을 좀 배웠는데, 나쁘지 않네.","source_cn":"从梅林那儿学了不少莱希拉姆的导师带学生的技巧，感觉还真...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0682D2B722330A8E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"멀린한테 라이세움이 학생을 가르치는 방법을 좀 배웠는데, 나쁘지 않네.","female":"멀린한테 라이세움이 학생을 가르치는 방법을 좀 배웠는데, 나쁘지 않네.","variant_male_record_index":"257288","variant_female_record_index":"257289","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041566017:1":{"text":"오랜만에 봤으니, 뭐 따로 회의할 건 없고... 그냥 여기서 보고만 해!","source_cn":"这么长时间不见了，也没必要开组会，就在这汇报吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB1A3DF8443B9238","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041566018:1":{"text":"...살려주세요...","source_cn":"……救命啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E0E9A8E023A6360","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"조아","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:呼金":{"text":"후긴","source":"呼金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":19,"localized_text_count":18,"speaker_count":2}}